1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760
These clowns stole a hundred million, then got sunk by a sandwich.

2
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:08,100
Antwerp, Belgium, the diamond capital of the whole damn world.

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:12,860
Now under its Diamond Centre sits a vault, layer after layer of security.

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:17,980
Inside are safe-deposit boxes, locked drawers people rent. Safe, right?

5
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:22,440
Now meet Leonardo Notarbartolo. He said he was a diamond dealer.

6
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:25,820
Then he rented an office in the building, so he could stroll in.

7
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,900
Double-tap if that's the smoothest cover story all week.

8
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:33,180
One weekend in February two thousand three, his crew gets into the vault.

9
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,540
They rip open box after box.

10
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,280
Estimates put the haul at about a hundred million dollars.

11
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:41,520
That's a thousand years at a hundred grand a year.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,060
Then came the last step, the easy one: burn the trash.

13
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,520
And these geniuses just didn't.

14
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:50,340
Now send this to the friend who'd screw up the easy step.

15
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:54,920
The bag got dumped by a road near Brussels, half-eaten salami sandwich inside.

16
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:58,400
Police say that sandwich carried Notarbartolo's DNA.

17
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:04,180
And it gets worse. Five days later, he strolls back into the Diamond Centre and gets arrested.

18
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:07,580
Follow if you live for watching geniuses fumble the bag.

19
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:11,400
In two thousand five, a court in Antwerp convicted him as the planner.

20
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,700
He was sentenced to ten years in prison.

21
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,920
Three of his crew got five years each.

22
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:18,420
And most of those diamonds? Never found.

23
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:22,620
Hundred million dollar heist, and his own shitty trash tied him to it.

24
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,060
Burn the bag or eat the sandwich, which one?

